<title>USA: West Co Q1 shr profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>West Co Q1 shr profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>LIONVILLE, Pa. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.51     loss	 $0.49</p>
<p> Net profit		 8,400     loss	 8,200</p>
<p> Sales		    114,700		  113,900</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  16,408		   16,631</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Q1 1996 includes a restructuring charge of $0.90 per share. Excluding the charge, net income would have been $0.41 per share.</p>
